      "title": "1. Component Suite Overview",
      "description": "Situation: All React components for annotation capture, floating toolbar, wireframe design mode, and settings popups reside in this folder."
    },
    {
      "file": "vendors/agentation-main/package/src/components/page-toolbar-css/index.tsx",
      "line": 325,
      "title": "2. PageFeedbackToolbarCSS Main Entry",
      "description": "Situation: Root component managing state hooks for active inspection, marker visibility, and modal dialogs.\nMechanism: React useState handles isActive, hoverInfo, pendingAnnotation, and showSettings."
    },
    {
      "file": "vendors/agentation-main/package/src/components/page-toolbar-css/index.tsx",
      "line": 97,
      "title": "3. Element Identification & React Detection Boundary",
      "description": "Situation: Hover & click inspector.\nMechanism: identifyElementWithReact pierces shadow DOM and inspects Fiber nodes to extract component names, CSS classes, computed styles, and accessibility attributes."
    },
    {
      "file": "vendors/agentation-main/package/src/components/annotation-popup-css/index.tsx",
      "line": 1,
      "title": "4. Annotation Popup CSS Modal",
      "description": "Situation: Comment editor popup modal.\nMechanism: Renders a floating textarea next to clicked target coordinates for agent feedback entry."
    },
    {
      "file": "vendors/agentation-main/package/src/components/page-toolbar-css/annotation-marker/index.tsx",
      "line": 1,
      "title": "5. Numbered Annotation Pin Markers",
      "description": "Situation: Pin badge markers.\nMechanism: Places numbered badge markers anchored to target coordinates with hover tooltips and right-click deletion."
    },
    {
      "file": "vendors/agentation-main/package/src/components/design-mode/index.tsx",
      "line": 1,
      "title": "6. Design Mode Wireframe System",
      "description": "Situation: Layout wireframe mode.\nMechanism: Section detection parses DOM elements to draw draggable, resizable section wireframes and alignment guides."
    },
    {
      "file": "vendors/agentation-main/package/src/components/design-mode/palette.tsx",
      "line": 1,
      "title": "7. Design Mode Element Palette",
      "description": "Situation: Element insertion sidebar.\nMechanism: Displays a palette grid for selecting pre-built wireframe components (Hero, Cards, Navigation, Forms)."
    },
    {
      "file": "vendors/agentation-main/package/src/components/page-toolbar-css/settings-panel/index.tsx",
      "line": 1,
      "title": "8. Settings & Webhook Panel",
      "description": "Situation: Settings modal.\nMechanism: Configures output detail levels, marker colors, dark/light themes, and real-time webhook endpoints."
    }
  ]
